From: Van Tran <trantoanvan@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:42:50 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(issues): when each open issue entered its status

GET /api/issues/status-since[?project_id=] lists, for every issue not done or
cancelled, its status and when it entered it (last status_changed activity,
else creation). Core @multica/core/board-gates: the query, daysInColumn, and
gateStatuses (steps a person approves). Reference: Jira's days in column.

Patch-Id: status-age
